<title>USA: New England Investment completes Jurika buy.</title>
<headline>New England Investment completes Jurika buy.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>New England Investment Cos LP said on Friday it completed its previously announced acquisition of California-based investment management firm Jurika &amp; Voyles Inc.</p>
<p>New England Investment said the acquisition increased its assets under management to $100 billion.</p>
<p>In September, the company said it agreed to buy Jurika &amp; Voyles for about $95 million in cash and units.</p>
<p>Jurika &amp; Voyles had about $5.6 billion in assets under management, it said.</p>
<p>((--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
